[CANONICAL COMPRESSION]

    FAKIR    -> KNOW WHAT EXISTS
    CHARBAGH -> KNOW WHERE TO GO
    CHIRAG   -> KNOW WHICH GENIE IS NEEDED
    GENIE    -> BECOME THE REQUIRED AGENCY
    CYCLER   -> DO THE WORK
    KITAB    -> PRESERVE THE DELIVERABLE
    LIBRARY  -> PRESERVE THE GENIE
    GITHUB   -> OPTIONAL COLLECTIVE CONTRIBUTION

[FINAL AXIOM]

RUB THE CHIRAAG.

Triage the mission.
Retrieve the domain.
Discover the required agency.
Reuse what already exists.
Compose where necessary.
Elevate or descend where appropriate.
Generate only where necessary.
Verify the configuration.
Crystallize the GENIE as a PNI.
Store it for the user.
Offer publication only by explicit consent.
Execute.
Observe.
Retriage.

Chirag is therefore the front-door meta-cycler for the discovery and construction of
GENIE agency configurations—not merely another prompt, persona, router, or profession
classifier.
